# Set these on your Convex deployment (they are used by Convex actions, not by Vite):
#   npx convex env set DAYTONA_API_KEY dtn_...
#   npx convex env set OPENAI_API_KEY sk-...
#
# DAYTONA_API_KEY  - create one at https://app.daytona.io/dashboard/keys
# OPENAI_API_KEY   - create one at https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
#
# VITE_CONVEX_URL is written to .env.local automatically by `npx convex dev`.
